---Automatically group pieces of a fractured Collection into a specified number of clusters
---@class FAutoClusterDataflowNode : FDataflowNode
---@field private ClusterSizeMethod EClusterSizeMethodEnum @How to choose the size of the clusters to create
---@field private ClusterSites integer @Use a Voronoi diagram with this many Voronoi sites as a guide for deciding cluster boundaries
---@field private ClusterFraction number @Choose the number of Voronoi sites used for clustering as a fraction of the number of child bones to process
---@field private SiteSize number @Choose the Edge-Size of the cube used to groups bones under a cluster (in cm).
---@field private ClusterGridWidth integer @Choose the number of cluster sites to distribute along the X axis
---@field private ClusterGridDepth integer @Choose the number of cluster sites to distribute along the Y axis
---@field private ClusterGridHeight integer @Choose the number of cluster sites to distribute along the Z axis
---@field private DriftIterations integer @For a grid distribution, optionally iteratively recenter the grid points to the center of the cluster geometry (technically: applying K-Means iterations) to balance the shape and distribution of the clusters
---@field private MinimumSize number @If a cluster has volume less than this value (in cm) cubed, then the auto-cluster process will attempt to merge it into a neighboring cluster.
---@field private bPreferConvexity boolean @Whether to favor clusters that have a convex shape. (Note: Does not support ByGrid clustering.)
---@field private ConcavityTolerance number @If > 0, cube root of maximum concave volume to add per cluster (ignoring concavity of individual parts)
---@field private AutoCluster boolean @If true, bones will only be added to the same cluster if they are physically connected (either directly, or via other bones in the same cluster)
---@field private EnforceSiteParameters boolean @If true, make sure the site parameters are matched as close as possible ( bEnforceConnectivity can make the number of site larger than the requested input may produce without it )
---@field private AvoidIsolated boolean @If true, prevent the creation of clusters with only a single child. Either by merging into a neighboring cluster, or not creating the cluster.
---@field private Collection FManagedArrayCollection @Fractured GeometryCollection to cluster
---@field private TransformSelection FDataflowTransformSelection @Bone selection for the clustering
---@field private Color FLinearColor
---@field private LineWidthMultiplier number
---@field private CenterColor FLinearColor
---@field private CenterSize number
---@field private bRandomizeColor boolean @Randomize color per connection
---@field private ColorRandomSeed integer @Random seed
local FAutoClusterDataflowNode = {}
